{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11877": "JUNA: 呃……嗯，没有梦境。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11878": "ALEXANDRA: 朱娜？是你吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11879": "JUNA: 亚历？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11880": "JUNA: 知道这里是怎么回事吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11881": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……你身后那块地方，有某种魔力流进来。是个很大的法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11882": "ALEXANDRA: 应该是困住我们的东西的一部分。可它不是土系魔法，我连碰都碰不到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11883": "JUNA: 其他人怎么找？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11884": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，对。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11885": "ALEXANDRA: 从这里跳下去，有条暗路通到另一边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11886": "JUNA: 确定？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11887": "ALEXANDRA: 八九不离十。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-gluEarthEnd-11888": "JUNA: 豁出去了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memWoman1-11889": "WOMAN: 我不是伊纳人，对不起，其实我都不该进入这座神殿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memWoman1-11890": "WOMAN: 可我丈夫是，我想让你记住他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memDancer-11891": "WOMAN: 踮脚，踮起脚尖，亲爱的，舞鞋就是为这个穿的，一、二、三……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memGirl-11892": "GIRL: 对，埃尔斯佩特，奶奶说森林里的花能让小哈伊姆好起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memSiege-11893": "MAN: 神殿的门很快就会被撞开，不然他们也会放火。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memSiege-11894": "MAN: 我正把魔像放进地基的裂缝里，有需要的话，他不吃不喝也能永远藏下去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memSiege-11895": "MAN: 彼得，你当时逃走是对的，我恐怕再也见不到你们了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memSiege-11896": "MAN: 我爱你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memJoke-11897": "MAN: 老头就说：“你母亲要是还活着，咱们能把整辆马车都藏起来！”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memGranny-11898": "OLD WOMAN: 听说你什么都记得住。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memGranny-11899": "OLD WOMAN: 那我就把所有孙辈的名字和生日都告诉你，足足十四个呢，可得请你帮我记着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memPoet-11900": "MAN: 这是儿子出生后我写的一首诗，好，听着……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memHussars-11901": "MAN: 足有四五千人，骑着马排成一道阵线。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memHussars-11902": "MAN: 光照在铠甲上，身后扬起尘土，像一道大浪漫过平原。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memGame-11903": "BOY: 平常玩是要叠在手背上，可进神殿前不能把手弄脏，所以……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-memRecipe-11904": "MAN: 这是我母亲的鸡汤食谱，我们族人就发明过这么一道好吃的，你可得记住，传给别人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikMemControls-11905": "ALEXANDRA: 嘿！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikMemControls-11906": "ALEXANDRA: 我们还是没到同一个地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikMemControls-11907": "ALEXANDRA: 从这里往北走，至少应该能回到另一侧上面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikMemControls-11908": "ALEXANDRA: 可现在，我也不知道自己能不能出去……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikMemControls-11909": "JUNA: 堵住了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikMemControls-11910": "ALEXANDRA: 看见那个发亮的东西了吗？是控制装置，我到处都看到过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikMemControls-11911": "JUNA: 控制什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-zikMemControls-11912": "ALEXANDRA: 不知道，先试试。我也看看这边能做什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGluBack-11913": "AGATA: 等等，下面好像是科黛莉娅的噩梦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGluBack-11914": "AGATA: 得请她帮忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11915": "CORDELIA: 啊，你们来了，帮我把顶层那本旧抄本拿下来，它太脆弱，经不起魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11916": "JUNA: 这里在干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11917": "CORDELIA: 繁重的政务。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11918": "JEROME: 你参加竞选了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11919": "CORDELIA: 勤勉的议员？真难想象。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11920": "CORDELIA: 不，重担都丢给了官僚机构，不过这或许反而更好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11921": "CORDELIA: 让他们去村里握手吧，真正的治理交给专家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11922": "JEROME: 具体在忙什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11923": "CORDELIA: 给议会和外交部准备简报。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11924": "CORDELIA: 如今其他世界的存在已广为人知，我们也因此面临一场政策危机。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11925": "CORDELIA: 得赶在恶徒扎稳脚跟前，主动监管世界之间的通行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11926": "CORDELIA: 惯例形成得很快，尤其是恶劣的惯例。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11927": "JUNA: 让她分一下心，应该就能醒了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11928": "JEROME: 能抽空帮个忙吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11929": "JEROME: 是，嗯……亚历珊德拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11930": "JEROME: 她试着摆弄一些东西，结果弄得失控了，想请你过去帮忙拆解一下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11931": "CORDELIA: 哦，亚历珊德拉？她做了什——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11932": "LEONA: 科黛莉娅！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11933": "LEONA: 财政部刚送来这些，要我们批准，说是急件。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11934": "CORDELIA: 他们永远这么说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11935": "JEROME: 等等，那……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11936": "JEROME: 那一定就是困住我们的家伙，不管它是什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11937": "JUNA: 这小虫子挺机灵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11938": "JEROME: 也许直接把科黛莉娅扛起来，走出幻象就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11939": "JEROME: 就算在梦里，她应该也不会对我用太可怕的法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11940": "JUNA: 嗯？那个捣蛋鬼之前可没使过这招。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11941": "JEROME: 不，是水魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11942": "JEROME: 一定是科黛莉娅自己做的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-cordeliaGlu1-11943": "JEROME: 先找其他人再回来吧，大家一起劝，也许有用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoFields1-11944": "BEN: 嘿，尼科，这是你的梦？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoFields1-11945": "NIKOLAI: 是吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoFields1-11946": "NIKOLAI: 我一直睡不好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoFields1-11947": "BEN: 现在在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoFields1-11948": "NIKOLAI: 邻居的农场。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoFields1-11949": "NIKOLAI: 从这里看不全，那片麦田绵延好几英里，望不到头。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoFields1-11950": "NIKOLAI: 收割前，山上的风会吹下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoFields1-11951": "NIKOLAI: 阵风掠过，就像巨人的手指梳过田野的长发。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoFields1-11952": "BEN: 班长，你还挺有诗意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoFields1-11953": "NIKOLAI: 来，给你们看看我们种的东西。趁这一切还没消失。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoCrows-11954": "NIKOLAI: 啊，田里有乌鸦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoCrows-11955": "NIKOLAI: 帮忙赶走吧，最近老拔我们的苗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoCrows-11956": "JUNA: 等等，你家不是开那个……面包店的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoCrows-11957": "NIKOLAI: 是，可我爸主要赚温泉游客的钱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoCrows-11958": "NIKOLAI: 淡季时，想攒点钱过秋节，就得下地干活。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoCrows-11959": "NIKOLAI: 田里还有，一只不剩都赶走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoCrows-11960": "NIKOLAI: 谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoCrows-11961": "NIKOLAI: 这几周干旱，想给几处嫩苗浇点水。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoCrows-11962": "NIKOLAI: 帮忙把水抽出来好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoCrows-11963": "NIKOLAI: 一直拉泵柄，直到水槽满了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoWaterBucket-11964": "NIKOLAI: 用水泵灌满水槽，不停拉泵柄就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoWaterBucket-11965": "NIKOLAI: 很好，现在每处嫩苗浇一桶。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoWaterBucket-11966": "NIKOLAI: 得全部浇完。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoDreamDebug-11967": "KERAUNOS: 想做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoDreamDebug-11968": "生成乌鸦",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoDreamDebug-11969": "完成驱赶乌鸦",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-nikoDreamDebug-11970": "灌满水槽并启用浇水点",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterB-11971": "给这些嫩苗浇水？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterB-11972": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterB-11973": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterB-11974": "需要水！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterC-11975": "给这些嫩苗浇水？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterC-11976": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterC-11977": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterC-11978": "需要水！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterD-11979": "给这些嫩苗浇水？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterD-11980": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterD-11981": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterD-11982": "需要水！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterA-11983": "给这些嫩苗浇水？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterA-11984": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterA-11985": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterA-11986": "需要水！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterE-11987": "给这些嫩苗浇水？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterE-11988": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterE-11989": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamWaterE-11990": "需要水！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamBoyA-11991": "BOY: 我想去博根看赛马。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamBoyB-11992": "BOY: 我和父亲快把新地清好了，又能多两英亩。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamBoyC-11993": "BOY: 母亲答应，只要成绩好就让我去海德堡的学院，祖父留了笔遗产，够交学费。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamBoyD-11994": "BOY: 村里的姑娘全是亲戚，一个也不能娶……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamBoyE-11995": "BOY: 爸爸死后，整座农场都得靠我和于尔根，我真想快点长大。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-11996": "NIKOLAI: 他们来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-11997": "JUNA: 嗯？谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-11998": "NIKOLAI: 住手，还没熟呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-11999": "ANSEITZ: 都得去收割，一个不留。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12000": "NIKOLAI: 我的国家，只剩这些了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12001": "JEROME: 我想你的国家还剩不少，对邻国来说，或许多得过头了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12002": "AGATA: 是啊，我们还苦战过，救下其中一角，你记得吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12003": "NIKOLAI: 不，我不是那个意思。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12004": "NIKOLAI: 以后人们想到奥斯伦，只会记得战争，还有我们在战争里干的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12005": "NIKOLAI: 不会想起我们唱的歌，也不会想起冬节里点满蜡烛的村庄。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12006": "NIKOLAI: 不会想起春天里穿白裙跳舞的姑娘，永远看不见餐桌上精心装饰的面包。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12007": "NIKOLAI: 只剩战争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12008": "AGATA: 你有过选择，你和你的国家都有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12009": "NIKOLAI: 也许我有，战前很久我就参军了，还是个班长，对做事的方式多少说得上话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12010": "NIKOLAI: 可这些孩子呢？有权势的人煞费苦心，给他们设好了选项，再逼着他们那么选，让他们服从。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12011": "NIKOLAI: 想想看，你加入守护者团是自己选的？还是别人替你选的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12012": "AGATA: 我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12013": "AGATA: 按规定，服役四年后可以离开，不过这不是重点。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12014": "AGATA: 留在边境外、留在原来的部族，我这一生恐怕都离不开暴力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12015": "AGATA:  选择留在阿科斯，意味着平静得多的生活。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12016": "NIKOLAI: 可这一切，是由比你更有势力、更有力量[oxfordComma /]也更有人脉的人促成的，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12017": "NIKOLAI: 听着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12018": "NIKOLAI: 我知道那位哲学家会说什么，这种事他从来讲个没完。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12019": "NIKOLAI: 他会说，你们国家让蛮族摆脱道德无知，我们国家却把人教成了尿床的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12020": "JEROME: 你想说的应该是道德上“不能自制”，可不是尿床。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12021": "NIKOLAI: 是啊，不过那些蛮族对他的看法，大概也有不少意见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12022": "AGATA: 你比谁都该清楚，真正重要的是在关键时刻、关键地方作出选择。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12023": "NIKOLAI: 可我并不是主动走到那一步的，我只是个说了声“是”的笨班长。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12024": "NIKOLAI: 话说，迈蒙人呢？我还以为这种话题一开头，他两秒钟就会冒出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12025": "NIKOLAI: 我在做梦，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12026": "BEN: 对，算是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12027": "NIKOLAI: 现在肯定醒了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12028": "BEN: 也算一种办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12029": "NIKOLAI: 我可不想再为自己叫屈了，实在丢人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12030": "NIKOLAI: 这是哪儿？我们在地下洞穴里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12031": "JUNA: 应该是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12032": "JUNA: 除了科黛莉娅和齐卡隆，大家都找到了，亚历在附近，不过……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-dreamHarvest-12033": "JUNA: 其实我有点担心她，能回去看看她有没有事吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/gluhender.yarn-alexZikaronTwo-12034": "JUNA: 她就在这附近。"
}
